# Copy this to .env.1password and replace item/field names with real 1Password references.
# Do not put raw API keys in this file.
#
# Examples:
# FMP_API_KEY=op://Private/FMP API Key/credential
# DART_API_KEY=op://Private/DART OpenAPI Key/credential
# NAVER_CLIENT_ID=op://Private/Naver Search API/client_id
# NAVER_CLIENT_SECRET=op://Private/Naver Search API/client_secret
#
# OpenBB/FMP style keys can be exported here once the exact provider env names are confirmed.
# Keep values as op:// references and run commands through scripts/run_with_1password.sh.

